      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Capsule, 2 cm wide and 6 cm long. Work the foot end in a contrasting colour for shoes. Stuff lightly."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Wings (make 2)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Flat oval, 4 cm long and 7 cm wide. Work in a pale iridescent or white yarn. Do not stuff."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Hat"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Cone hat, 5 cm base and 6 cm tall. Work in the same colour as the body dress section. Do not stuff."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Assembly"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Sew the head to the body. Attach the arms to the upper sides of the body. Sew the legs to the base of the body. Pin the wings to the back of the body and sew flat using a "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "invisible-decrease-a74"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "invisible decrease"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " technique for joins. Position the hat on the head and sew around the brim."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Skirt fringe"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Cut short lengths of sparkle or contrast yarn, each about 6 cm. Using a crochet hook, pull each piece through a stitch at the lower third of the body to create a "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "fringe-trim-a74"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "fringe trim"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " skirt. Trim the fringe to an even length."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Materials needed"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Approximately 29 g skin-tone dk yarn, small amounts of white or iridescent yarn for wings. 9 mm safety eyes. Polyester stuffing. Tapestry needle."
